{% comment %}
  HOUSE OF AGHA — SCENT NOTES (PDP "Scent profile", notes_cards in product.json)
  2026-10-09 v2, from the user's sketch + reference poster ("House of Agha · Oud Fury Notes"):
  the bottle stands in the middle and three tinted pill cards are tucked BEHIND it — Top notes
  upper-left (its end hidden behind the cap), Heart notes on the right, Base notes lower-left —
  each with round note photos and small spaced captions. A poster frame around it: tagline
  top-left, "House of Agha" + a hairline top-centre, product name top-right, and "Scent notes"
  set large on the left with an italic line under it.
  (The earlier light sticker cards with pins / spritz / word band were replaced by this.)

  Motion: a scroll story — the section pins and each scroll step brings the next card out from
  behind the bottle (Top → Heart → Base), reversed on the way back up; cards spring in, their
  rule draws, the note circles pop one by one, then they bob gently; hover lifts a card. No JS = everything
  shown, static. prefers-reduced-motion: static.
  Phones (<700px): bottle first, the cards stacked under it, alternating sides.

  Data
    Cards ...... "note_card" blocks (first 3 used on the stage): label, notes source, fallback
                 caption, card + text colour.
    Notes ...... notes source top / heart / base → custom.top_notes / heart_notes / base_notes
                 through snippets/agha-pdp-data (its dev fallback while metafields are empty),
                 else the block's caption. Up to 3 notes per card (user, 2026-10-09); each photo comes from
                 snippets/agha-note-image set 'sn' (assets/sn-note-<key>.webp, cut from the reference
                 poster: saffron, bergamot, lavender, oud, jasmine, neroli, cardamom, sandalwood,
                 amber; others fall back to note-<key>.jpg), a letter shows when missing.
    Still life .. assets/sn-pile-botanical.webp (left) + sn-pile-oud.webp (right, behind the glass),
                 transparent cut-outs from the same poster, at the bottle's foot as in the poster.
    Bottle ..... section image → transparent cutout assets/hoa-bottle-<handle>.webp →
                 product.featured_image.
  Local preview: assets/pdp-preview.js mirrors the markup and reuses this file's style and
  script blocks (matched at the start of a line — never start a comment line with one).
{% endcomment %}

{%- capture pdp_json -%}{%- render 'agha-pdp-data' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign pdp = pdp_json | parse_json -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign cutouts = 'agha-blue,dark-paradise,maha,oud-fury,sea-smoke,shamamah,tobacco-enigma' | split: ','
  assign product_title = product.title | default: 'House of Agha'
  assign bottle_alt = product_title | append: ' bottle'
  assign has_cutout = false
  assign cut_key = product.handle | remove: 'oud-of-'
  if cut_key == 'dark-paradise-oud'
    assign cut_key = 'dark-paradise'
  endif
  if product and cutouts contains cut_key
    assign has_cutout = true
    assign cut = 'hoa-bottle-' | append: cut_key | append: '.webp'
  endif
  comment
    Resting tilt per card (deg), in block order: top, heart, base
  endcomment
  assign rots = '-6,7,-9' | split: ','

  comment
    The notes depend on the product: a card shows the product's own notes (metafield, else the
    live-store notes in snippets/agha-store-notes). The block's list is used only when its source
    is "none". A card with no notes is left out; no notes at all = no section (e.g. Shamamah).
  endcomment
  assign any_notes = false
  for block in section.blocks limit: 3
    case block.settings.notes_source
      when 'top'
        if pdp.top_notes != blank
          assign any_notes = true
        endif
      when 'heart'
        if pdp.heart_notes != blank
          assign any_notes = true
        endif
      when 'base'
        if pdp.base_notes != blank
          assign any_notes = true
        endif
      else
        if block.settings.caption != blank
          assign any_notes = true
        endif
    endcase
  endfor
-%}

<style>
  /* ======================================================================
     SCENT NOTES — scoped to .sn
     li.sn-card ....... placement + resting tilt (--rot) + the slide-out
     .sn-card__in ..... idle bob and hover lift
     .sn-card__body ... the pill itself
     ====================================================================== */
  .sn {
    --sn-ink: #1c1915;
    --sn-muted: #6d665c;
    --bh: clamp(420px, 44vw, 580px);   /* bottle height: every card is placed from it */
    --bw: calc(var(--bh) * 0.38);       /* bottle width (cutouts are 289×760) */
    --cw: calc(var(--bh) * 0.7);        /* card width */
    --tuck: calc(var(--bh) * 0.075);    /* how far a card runs in behind the bottle */
    --ck: calc(var(--bh) * 0.78);       /* card scale: medium cards (user, 2026-10-09) */
    position: relative;
    background: var(--sn-bg, #f6f4ee);
    color: var(--sn-ink);
    padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px);
    overflow-x: clip;
  }
  .sn__inner { position: relative; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; }

  /* Poster frame: tagline · brand · product */
  .sn__top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .sn__tagline,
  .sn__brand,
  .sn__product {
    margin: 0;
    font: 400 0.7rem/1.75 var(--font-serif, Georgia, serif);
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .sn__tagline { max-width: 17em; color: var(--sn-muted); }
  .sn__tagline::after,
  .sn__product::after { content: ""; display: block; width: 38px; margin-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid currentColor; opacity: 0.6; }
  .sn__brand { display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 18px; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.42em; }
  .sn__brand::after { content: ""; width: 1px; height: 46px; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.5; }
  .sn__product { justify-self: end; text-align: right; font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.24em; }
  .sn__product em { display: block; font-style: italic; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--sn-muted); }
  .sn__product::after { margin-left: auto; }

  /* "Scent notes" — big on the left of the stage (wide screens), above it otherwise */
  /* lower right, clear of the cards on the left (the base card's width follows the product's notes) */
  .sn__head { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 2%; z-index: 3; width: min(270px, 21%); text-align: right; }
  .sn__head .sn__sub { background-position: 100% 0; }
  .sn .sn__title {
    margin: 0;
    font: 400 clamp(2.6rem, 4.4vw, 4rem)/0.95 var(--font-didot, 'Didot', Georgia, serif);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: var(--sn-ink);
  }
  .sn__title span { display: block; padding-left: 0.6em; }
  .sn__head .sn__title span { padding-left: 0; }
  .sn__sub {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    padding-top: 18px;
    font: italic 400 1rem/1.6 var(--font-serif, Georgia, serif);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--sn-muted);
    background: linear-gradient(currentColor, currentColor) 0 0 / 38px 1px no-repeat;
  }

  /* Stage: the bottle's centre is the stage's centre */
  .sn__stage {
    position: relative;
    height: calc(var(--bh) + clamp(60px, 8vw, 110px));
    margin-top: clamp(-30px, -2vw, 0px);
  }
  .sn__bottle { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; z-index: 3; translate: -50% -50%; }
  .sn__img { display: block; height: var(--bh); width: auto; max-width: none; -webkit-box-reflect: below 0 linear-gradient(transparent 86%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16)); }
  .sn__shadow {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: calc(100% - 6px);
    width: 150%;
    height: 26px;
    translate: -50% 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(40, 28, 16, 0.26), transparent);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .sn__cards { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  .sn-card {
    --c-bg: #ffffff;
    --c-ink: #3a3245;
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    width: max-content;
    transform: rotate(var(--rot, 0deg));
  }
  /* Where each card sits, measured from the bottle (stage centre) */
  .sn-card[data-slot="1"] { right: calc(50% - var(--bw) * 0.02); top: calc(50% - var(--bh) * 0.46); }
  .sn-card[data-slot="2"] { left: calc(50% + var(--bw) * 0.5 - var(--tuck)); top: calc(50% - var(--bh) * 0.22); }
  .sn-card[data-slot="3"] { right: calc(50% + var(--bw) * 0.5 - var(--tuck)); top: calc(50% + var(--bh) * 0.1); }

  /* Ingredient still life at the bottle's foot, as in the reference poster: the botanicals
     (bergamot, lime, lavender, saffron, amber) on the LEFT against the glass, the oud wood + amber
     on the RIGHT running in behind the bottle; all on a glossy floor (soft reflection below) */
  .sn__pile {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: calc(50% - var(--bh) * 0.52);
    height: auto;
    pointer-events: none;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 8px rgba(40, 28, 16, 0.2));
    -webkit-box-reflect: below -4px linear-gradient(transparent 82%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14));
  }
  .sn__pile--botanical { z-index: 4; right: calc(50% + var(--bw) * 0.5 - var(--bh) * 0.05); width: calc(var(--bh) * 0.46); }
  .sn__pile--oud { z-index: 2; left: calc(50% + var(--bw) * 0.5 - var(--bh) * 0.11); width: calc(var(--bh) * 0.52); }

  .sn-card__in { transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1); }
  .sn-card__body {
    position: relative;
    padding: calc(var(--ck) * 0.045) calc(var(--ck) * 0.07) calc(var(--ck) * 0.04);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 90% at 30% 10%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28), transparent 60%),
      var(--c-bg);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35),
      0 2px 4px rgba(40, 28, 16, 0.06),
      0 22px 44px -22px rgba(40, 28, 16, 0.45);
  }
  /* The end that runs in behind the bottle gets extra room so no note hides under it */
  .sn-card[data-slot="1"] .sn-card__body { padding-right: calc(var(--bw) * 0.5 + var(--ck) * 0.04); }
  .sn-card[data-slot="2"] .sn-card__body { padding-left: calc(var(--tuck) + var(--ck) * 0.05); }
  .sn-card[data-slot="3"] .sn-card__body { padding-right: calc(var(--tuck) + var(--ck) * 0.05); }

  .sn-card__label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 calc(var(--ck) * 0.022);
    font: 500 calc(var(--ck) * 0.03)/1 var(--font-serif, Georgia, serif);
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .sn-card__label::after { content: ""; flex: 0 0 calc(var(--ck) * 0.07); border-top: 1px solid currentColor; opacity: 0.55; }

  /* Same card size on every product: room for exactly 3 notes; fewer notes sit centred in it */
  .sn-card__notes { --nw: calc(var(--ck) * 0.18); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: calc(var(--ck) * 0.02); width: calc(var(--nw) * 3 + var(--ck) * 0.04); margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  /* a long single word (FRANKINCENSE) widens its own column instead of running into the next */
  .sn-note { display: grid; justify-items: center; align-content: start; gap: calc(var(--ck) * 0.016); width: var(--nw); flex: none; }
  .sn-note__pic {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: calc(var(--ck) * 0.13);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75), 0 8px 16px -8px rgba(30, 20, 10, 0.5);
    font: 400 1.4rem/1 var(--font-didot, Georgia, serif);
    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
  }
  .sn-note__pic img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .sn-note__name {
    font: 500 max(9px, calc(var(--ck) * 0.02))/1.3 var(--font-serif, Georgia, serif);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Hover: the card lifts, its notes swell a little */
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .sn-card:hover .sn-card__in { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    .sn-card:hover .sn-note__pic,
    .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card.is-on:hover .sn-note__pic { transform: scale(1.06); }
  }

  /* ---------- Scroll story (2026-10-09, user): the section pins and each scroll step brings in
     the next card (Top → Heart → Base); scrolling back up takes them away again. JS sets
     .sn--pin (desktop), .is-in on the section and .is-on on each card. No JS = all shown. */
  .sn.sn--pin { height: calc(100vh + 150vh); padding-block: 0; }
  .sn--pin .sn__inner {
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--hoa-header-h, 76px);
    height: calc(100vh - var(--hoa-header-h, 76px));
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  /* the pinned stage must fit the screen under the header */
  .sn.sn--pin { --bh: min(clamp(420px, 44vw, 580px), calc(100vh - var(--hoa-header-h, 76px) - 230px)); }

  /* Bottle + still life: rise in with the section */
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn__bottle { opacity: 0; translate: -50% calc(-50% + 40px); transition: opacity 0.8s ease, translate 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1); }
  .sn[data-sn-ready].is-in .sn__bottle { opacity: 1; translate: -50% -50%; }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn__pile { opacity: 0; translate: 0 24px; transition: opacity 0.8s ease 0.3s, translate 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.3s; }
  .sn[data-sn-ready].is-in .sn__pile { opacity: 1; translate: none; }

  /* Card motion. Arriving (.is-on): springs out from behind the glass, unblurs, settles on its
     tilt; then the label's rule draws, the note circles pop one by one and the names rise.
     Leaving (scrolling back up, user 2026-10-09): the same film played backwards — names drop,
     circles shrink out last-to-first, the rule retracts, then the card pulls back (a small
     anticipation) and slides in behind the bottle. Base-state transitions = the exit. */
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card {
    opacity: 0;
    filter: blur(6px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease 0.5s, transform 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.5, -0.45, 0.66, 0) 0.3s, filter 0.5s ease 0.45s;
  }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card[data-slot="1"],
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card[data-slot="3"] { transform: translateX(42%) rotate(0deg) scale(0.8); }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card[data-slot="2"] { transform: translateX(-42%) rotate(0deg) scale(0.8); }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card.is-on {
    opacity: 1;
    filter: none;
    transform: rotate(var(--rot, 0deg));
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 1s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.5, 0.5, 1), filter 0.6s ease;
  }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card__label::after { transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: 0 50%; transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.64, 0, 0.78, 0) 0.2s; }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card.is-on .sn-card__label::after { transform: scaleX(1); transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.35s; }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-note__pic { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.3); transition: opacity 0.3s ease calc(var(--xd) + 0.08s), transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0, 0.66, -0.56) var(--xd); }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-note__name { opacity: 0; translate: 0 8px; transition: opacity 0.25s ease var(--xd), translate 0.3s ease var(--xd); }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card.is-on .sn-note__pic { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: opacity 0.35s ease var(--nd), transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.7, 0.5, 1) var(--nd); }
  .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card.is-on .sn-note__name { opacity: 0.85; translate: none; transition: opacity 0.4s ease calc(var(--nd) + 0.12s), translate 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) calc(var(--nd) + 0.12s); }
  /* --nd = arrival delay (first to last), --xd = leaving delay (last to first) */
  .sn-note:nth-child(1) { --nd: 0.32s; --xd: 0.16s; }
  .sn-note:nth-child(2) { --nd: 0.42s; --xd: 0.08s; }
  .sn-note:nth-child(3) { --nd: 0.52s; --xd: 0s; }

  /* idle bob once a card has landed */
  .sn-card.is-on .sn-card__body { animation: sn-bob 4s ease-in-out 1.1s infinite alternate; }
  .sn-card[data-slot="2"] .sn-card__body { animation-duration: 4.6s; }
  .sn-card[data-slot="3"] .sn-card__body { animation-duration: 3.6s; }
  @keyframes sn-bob { to { transform: translateY(-6px); } }

  /* Mid widths: the title moves above the stage */
  @media (max-width: 1199px) {
    .sn__head { position: static; width: auto; margin: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px) 0 0; text-align: center; }

    .sn__title span { display: inline; padding: 0; }
    .sn__head .sn__sub { max-width: 30em; margin-inline: auto; background-position: 50% 0; }
    .sn__stage { margin-top: 0; }
    .sn.sn--pin { --bh: min(clamp(420px, 44vw, 580px), calc(100vh - var(--hoa-header-h, 76px) - 380px)); }
    .sn--pin .sn__head { margin-top: 8px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .sn { --bh: 400px; }
    .sn.sn--pin { --bh: min(400px, calc(100vh - var(--hoa-header-h, 76px) - 360px)); }
    .sn__tagline { display: none; }
    .sn__top { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
  }

  /* Phones: bottle first, then the cards stacked, alternating sides */
  @media (max-width: 699px) {
    .sn { --bh: 330px; padding-inline: 16px; }
    .sn__top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; justify-items: center; text-align: center; }
    .sn__product { justify-self: center; text-align: center; }
    .sn__product::after { margin-inline: auto; }
    .sn__brand::after { height: 28px; }
    .sn__stage { height: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; margin-top: 12px; }
    .sn__bottle { position: relative; left: auto; top: auto; translate: none; }
    /* the still life hangs off the bottle's foot (bottle = top of the stage here) */
    .sn__pile { bottom: auto; }
    .sn__pile--botanical { width: calc(var(--bh) * 0.4); top: calc(var(--bh) * 0.6); }
    .sn__pile--oud { width: calc(var(--bh) * 0.38); top: calc(var(--bh) * 0.78); }
    .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn__bottle { translate: 0 30px; }
    .sn[data-sn-ready].is-in .sn__bottle { translate: none; }
    .sn__cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; width: 100%; margin-top: 34px; }
    .sn-card { position: relative; left: auto !important; right: auto !important; top: auto !important; width: min(100%, 340px); --rot: 0deg; }
    .sn-card:nth-child(odd) { align-self: flex-start; --rot: -3deg; }
    .sn-card:nth-child(even) { align-self: flex-end; --rot: 3deg; }
    .sn-card .sn-card__body { padding: 18px 26px 16px !important; }
    .sn-card__label { font-size: 0.78rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .sn-note__pic { width: 62px; }
    .sn-card__notes { --nw: 76px; gap: 8px; width: calc(76px * 3 + 16px); }
    .sn-note__name { font-size: 0.6rem; }
    .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card[data-slot] { transform: translateY(36px) rotate(0deg) scale(0.92); }
    .sn[data-sn-ready] .sn-card[data-slot].is-on { transform: rotate(var(--rot)); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .sn .sn-card,
    .sn .sn__bottle,
    .sn .sn-note__pic,
    .sn .sn-note__name { opacity: 1 !important; filter: none !important; transition: none !important; }
    .sn .sn-card[data-slot] { transform: rotate(var(--rot, 0deg)) !important; }
    .sn .sn-card__body { animation: none !important; }
    .sn .sn-card__in, .sn .sn-note__pic { transition: none; }
  }
</style>

{%- if any_notes -%}
<section
  class="sn"
  id="sn-{{ section.id }}"
  style="--sn-bg: {{ s.background }};"
  data-sn
  aria-labelledby="sn-{{ section.id }}-title"
>
  <div class="sn__inner">
    <div class="sn__top">
      <p class="sn__tagline">{{ s.tagline }}</p>
      <p class="sn__brand">{{ s.brand }}</p>
      <p class="sn__product">{{ product_title }}{% if s.product_line != blank %}<em>{{ s.product_line }}</em>{% endif %}</p>
    </div>

    <header class="sn__head">
      {%- assign title_words = s.heading | split: ' ' -%}
      <h2 class="sn__title" id="sn-{{ section.id }}-title">{{ title_words.first }}{% if title_words.size > 1 %} <span>{{ title_words | slice: 1, 10 | join: ' ' }}</span>{% endif %}</h2>
      {%- if s.subheading != blank -%}<p class="sn__sub">{{ s.subheading }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    </header>

    <div class="sn__stage">
      <div class="sn__bottle">
        {%- if s.bottle != blank -%}
          {{ s.bottle | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: '400, 600, 800, 1000', sizes: '(min-width: 700px) 20vw, 40vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: bottle_alt, class: 'sn__img' }}
        {%- elsif has_cutout -%}
          <img class="sn__img" src="{{ cut | asset_url }}" width="289" height="760" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{{ bottle_alt | escape }}">
        {%- elsif product.featured_image -%}
          {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: '400, 600, 800, 1000', sizes: '(min-width: 700px) 20vw, 40vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: bottle_alt, class: 'sn__img' }}
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="sn__shadow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      {%- if s.show_still_life -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Per product: the ingredients at the bottle's foot follow that product's notes. Products
          listed in pile_keys have their own assets/sn-pile-<key>-left.webp / -right.webp (top /
          fresh notes on the left, base / woody notes on the right); the rest show the poster's set. Per-product sets were generated
          2026-10-09 (Higgsfield nano_banana_2, poster style) and cut out.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign pile_keys = 'oud-fury,agha-blue,dark-paradise,maha,sea-smoke,tobacco-enigma' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- assign pile_left = 'sn-pile-botanical.webp' -%}
        {%- assign pile_right = 'sn-pile-oud.webp' -%}
        {%- if pile_keys contains cut_key -%}
          {%- assign pile_left = 'sn-pile-' | append: cut_key | append: '-left.webp' -%}
          {%- assign pile_right = 'sn-pile-' | append: cut_key | append: '-right.webp' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        <img class="sn__pile sn__pile--oud" src="{{ pile_right | asset_url }}" width="556" height="354" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="">
        {%- comment -%} Left side has no ingredients (user, 2026-10-09): that space belongs to the Base notes card {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      <ul class="sn__cards" role="list">
        {%- for block in section.blocks limit: 3 -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign b = block.settings
            assign list = b.caption
            case b.notes_source
              when 'top'
                assign list = pdp.top_notes
              when 'heart'
                assign list = pdp.heart_notes
              when 'base'
                assign list = pdp.base_notes
            endcase
            if list == blank
              continue
            endif
            assign names = list | split: ','
            assign rot = rots[forloop.index0] | default: 0
            assign delay = forloop.index0 | times: 0.16 | plus: 0.25
          -%}
          <li
            class="sn-card"
            data-slot="{{ forloop.index }}"
            style="--rot: {{ rot }}deg; --d: {{ delay }}s; --c-bg: {{ b.card_color }}; --c-ink: {{ b.text_color }};"
            {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
          >
            <div class="sn-card__in">
              <div class="sn-card__body">
                <h3 class="sn-card__label">{{ b.label }}</h3>
                <ul class="sn-card__notes" role="list">
                  {%- for n in names limit: 3 -%}
                    {%- assign note_name = n | strip -%}
                    {%- if note_name != blank -%}
                      <li class="sn-note">
                        <span class="sn-note__pic" aria-hidden="true">{{ note_name | slice: 0 }}<img src="{% render 'agha-note-image', name: note_name, set: 'sn' %}" alt="" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy" onerror="this.remove()"></span>
                        <span class="sn-note__name">{{ note_name }}</span>
                      </li>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

<script>
  /* SCENT NOTES — scroll story. Desktop (≥700px wide, ≥700px tall): the section pins
     (.sn--pin) and the scroll through it reveals one card per step: Top, Heart, Base. Scroll back
     up and they leave in reverse. Phones: each card arrives as it scrolls up into view and leaves
     again when you scroll back above it. Reduced motion / no JS: everything shown, static. */
  (function () {
    var STEPS = [0.1, 0.4, 0.7]; // pinned progress at which card 1, 2, 3 arrive

    function init(root) {
      if (root._sn) return;
      root._sn = true;
      if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;
      root.setAttribute('data-sn-ready', '');
      var inner = root.querySelector('.sn__inner');
      var cards = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.sn-card'));
      var wide = window.matchMedia('(min-width: 700px)');
      var queued = false;

      function update() {
        queued = false;
        var vh = window.innerHeight;
        var pin = wide.matches && vh >= 700;
        root.classList.toggle('sn--pin', pin);
        var r = root.getBoundingClientRect();
        root.classList.toggle('is-in', r.top < vh * 0.75 && r.bottom > 0);
        if (pin) {
          var top = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(inner).top) || 0;
          var range = root.offsetHeight - inner.offsetHeight;
          var p = range > 0 ? (top - r.top) / range : 1;
          cards.forEach(function (c, i) { c.classList.toggle('is-on', p >= STEPS[Math.min(i, STEPS.length - 1)]); });
        } else {
          cards.forEach(function (c) { c.classList.toggle('is-on', c.getBoundingClientRect().top < vh * 0.85); });
        }
      }
      function queue() { if (!queued) { queued = true; requestAnimationFrame(update); } }
      window.addEventListener('scroll', queue, { passive: true });
      window.addEventListener('resize', queue);
      update();
    }
    function boot(scope) { [].forEach.call(scope.querySelectorAll('[data-sn]'), init); }
    if (window.HOA_SN) { window.HOA_SN.boot(document); return; }
    window.HOA_SN = { boot: boot };
    document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) { boot(e.target); });
    if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () { boot(document); });
    else boot(document);
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Scent notes",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "sn-section",
  "max_blocks": 3,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "Tagline (top left)", "default": "A fragrance crafted from nature's finest elements" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand", "label": "Brand line (top centre)", "default": "House of Agha" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "product_line", "label": "Under the product name (top right)", "default": "Eau de Parfum" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Scent notes", "info": "The first word sits on its own line." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subheading", "label": "Line under the heading", "default": "A bold blend of rare ingredients, crafted to leave a lasting impression." },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background", "label": "Background colour", "default": "#f6f4ee" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_still_life", "label": "Show ingredients at the bottle's foot", "default": true },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "bottle", "label": "Bottle image", "info": "A transparent PNG works best. Empty: the theme's bottle cutout for this product, then the product's featured image." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Card positions: 1st = upper left (behind the cap), 2nd = right, 3rd = lower left." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "note_card",
      "name": "Note card",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "Top notes" },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "notes_source",
          "label": "Notes from",
          "default": "top",
          "options": [
            { "value": "top", "label": "custom.top_notes" },
            { "value": "heart", "label": "custom.heart_notes" },
            { "value": "base", "label": "custom.base_notes" },
            { "value": "none", "label": "Only the list below" }
          ]
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "caption", "label": "Notes (only when \"Notes from\" is the list below)", "default": "Saffron, Bergamot, Lavender", "info": "Comma separated, up to 3. Product notes always come from the product, so this card shows nothing for a product without them." },
        { "type": "color", "id": "card_color", "label": "Card colour", "default": "#ffffff" },
        { "type": "color", "id": "text_color", "label": "Text colour", "default": "#2b2620" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Scent notes",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "note_card", "settings": { "label": "Top notes", "notes_source": "top", "caption": "Saffron, Bergamot, Lavender", "card_color": "#ffffff", "text_color": "#2b2620" } },
        { "type": "note_card", "settings": { "label": "Heart notes", "notes_source": "heart", "caption": "Oud, Jasmine, Neroli", "card_color": "#b9c7a5", "text_color": "#2c3a24" } },
        { "type": "note_card", "settings": { "label": "Base notes", "notes_source": "base", "caption": "Cardamom, Sandalwood, Amber", "card_color": "#ead08a", "text_color": "#3d2f17" } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
